  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Retrieves a user's domain names ranked by traffic.\nIf you do not specify StartTime and EndTime, data for the current month is retrieved by default. To query data over a specific time range, you must specify both StartTime and EndTime.\n* You can retrieve data for a maximum of 90 days",
